# Google Workspace Docs / Sheets

## Gate

Use when the user asks to read or edit a Google Doc or Spreadsheet. Prefer
Google Workspace MCP.

## Defaults

1. Never invent document or spreadsheet ids.
2. Prefer section / range edits over full-document rewrites.
3. Sheets: name the tab and A1 range; do not overwrite unrelated cells.
4. Preserve existing structure unless asked to reformat.
5. Export to PDF only when requested.

## Refuse

- Do not delete tabs or wipe sheets without an explicit ask.
- Do not paste secrets into shared docs.
